# Plumb the Forbidden's Cost$ 1 B Sac<X/Creature> announces X before the
# sacrifice (PlaySpellAbility.announceValuesLikeX); its SpellCast trigger's
# CheckSVar$ CastSA>Count$xPaid reads that X off the cast SpellAbility
# (AbilityUtils.java:1890-1891 with the cast SA as ctb) and copies the spell
